# Ownership for the methods and their mirror.
#
# The Python reference (hyphaeon/), its JavaScript port (js/), the fixtures generated from the
# one and replayed by the other (fixtures/), and the exported models plus manifest (models/) are
# one thing reviewed by one set of people: a change to a method and its port land in the same
# pull request, side by side (PLAN.md 5.5 in veg/hyphaeon-app).
#
# @veg/hyphaeon-maintainers is a placeholder. Replace it with the real GitHub team (or a list of
# users) once the team exists; CODEOWNERS is silently ignored for a team that does not.

/hyphaeon/  @veg/hyphaeon-maintainers
/js/        @veg/hyphaeon-maintainers
/fixtures/  @veg/hyphaeon-maintainers
/models/    @veg/hyphaeon-maintainers
